    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "下午两点，爸爸妈妈出去了，我一个人在家。",
      "traditional": "下午兩點，爸爸媽媽出去了，我一個人在家。",
      "pinyin": "xià wǔ liǎng diǎn bà ba mā ma chū qù le wǒ yí ge rén zài jiā",
      "english": "At 2 pm, Mom and Dad had gone out, and I was at home alone."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我在睡觉，有人在门外。是谁呢？",
      "traditional": "我在睡覺，有人在門外。是誰呢？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zài shuì jiào yǒu rén zài mén wài shì shéi ne",
      "english": "I was sleeping, and someone was outside the door. Who was it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我起来，看到门外是妈妈的好朋友果果，她拿着蛋糕。",
      "traditional": "我起來，看到門外是媽媽的好朋友果果，她拿著蛋糕。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ qǐ lai kàn dào mén wài shì mā ma de hǎo péng you guǒ guǒ tā ná zhe dàn gāo",
      "english": "I got up and saw it was Mom’s good friend Guoguo outside the door. She was holding a cake."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "今天是妈妈的生日，果果想和妈妈一起过生日吧。",
      "traditional": "今天是媽媽的生日，果果想和媽媽一起過生日吧。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì mā ma de shēng rì guǒ guǒ xiǎng hé mā ma yì qǐ guò shēng rì ba",
      "english": "Today was Mom’s birthday. Guoguo wanted to celebrate Mom’s birthday with her."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我想给果果开门，但是我不会开门。",
      "traditional": "我想給果果開門，但是我不會開門。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng gěi guǒ guǒ kāi mén dàn shì wǒ bú huì kāi mén",
      "english": "I wanted to open the door for Guoguo, but I couldn’t open the door."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "我和果果说，妈妈出去了，但是果果没有听见。",
      "traditional": "我和果果說，媽媽出去了，但是果果沒有聽見。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hé guǒ guǒ shuō mā ma chū qù le dàn shì guǒ guǒ méi yǒu tīng jiàn",
      "english": "I told Guoguo that Mom had gone out, but Guoguo didn’t hear me."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "果果在门外等了一会儿，看到没有人开门，她就走了。",
      "traditional": "果果在門外等了一會兒，看到沒有人開門，她就走了。",
      "pinyin": "guǒ guǒ zài mén wài děng le yí huì'r kàn dào méi yǒu rén kāi mén tā jiù zǒu le",
      "english": "Guoguo waited outside the door for a while, and when she saw that no one was opening the door, she left."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "我又去睡觉。不一会儿，又有人在门外。果果又来了吗？",
      "traditional": "我又去睡覺。不一會兒，又有人在門外。果果又來了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yòu qù shuì jiào bù yí huì'r yòu yǒu rén zài mén wài guǒ guǒ yòu lái le ma",
      "english": "I went to sleep again. After a while, someone was outside the door again. Had Guoguo come again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "我起来，看到门外的人不是果果，是一个男人。这个人我不认识。",
      "traditional": "我起來，看到門外的人不是果果，是一個男人。這個人我不認識。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ qǐ lai kàn dào mén wài de rén bú shì guǒ guǒ shì yí ge nán rén zhè ge rén wǒ bú rèn shi",
      "english": "I got up and saw that the person outside was not Guoguo. It was a man. I didn’t recognize this person."
    },
